{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54113","headline":"西郎山 · 曹邺","name":"西郎山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西郎何事面西方？欲会东郎隔大江。\n自古朋良时一遇，东郎未会恨斜阳。\n（均见清汪森辑《粤西诗载》卷二二）（按：以上三诗，梁超然先生《曹邺诗注》已收入。\n《文学评论丛刊》第七辑刊同人《论晚唐诗人曹邺》云：「《东郎山》、《西郎山》二诗在阳朔东、西郎山有石刻。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}